1ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"NHL1c_30iYXvJZcqEo6fwQ","review_id":"IiRljEU_OoeFJq_ASDcBgA","date":"2011-11-29T20:33:46","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9429261684417725,"text_excerpt":"I really like Pal's and I love the \"special\" wallpaper in the men's restroom here. They often have cheap and free food specials. They have outstanding bartenders that always make sure you have a good time. They have a security officer at the front door and you have to get buzzed in by the bartender (as the neighborhood used to be a lot more shady and might still have some shady characters occasionally but it seems to be getting better and better around the area all the time). I've never had any problems in this area and I've been here at ALL hours. I've always had a fantastic time in this bar and they are always making some very creative cocktails. They also have all sorts of fun games in..."},{"business_id":"NHL1c_30iYXvJZcqEo6fwQ","review_id":"itKPDo_63GxB-OQnzZR5wQ","date":"2016-01-03T17:37:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.941527247428894,"text_excerpt":"What a quaint little neighborhood bar. I was pleasantly surprised to find out they could make a really good french 75. Pal's is fancy AF. I'd say its a bump up from a dive bar, but still really chill. On a Wednesday night it was pretty packed, but it was over the holidays so its hard to really judge if that was the average crowd. Everyone from the bartenders to the other patrons were friendly and nice and said \"excuse me\" if they bumped you. A rarity these days. I really enjoyed the bathrooms, mainly because I had to climb up Rapunzel's tower to get to it. (disclaimer: it's really like 4 or 5 steps) I also enjoyed having to get buzzed in, which only adds to the enchantment. I am I creatur..."},{"business_id":"NHL1c_30iYXvJZcqEo6fwQ","review_id":"-av3LytXSQZ-sokQN821ag","date":"2017-02-03T05:30:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9404484033584595,"text_excerpt":"Such a cool hole in the wall neighborhood bar. Had such a cool down to earth feel and all types of people are patrons. The drinks are made well and relatively inexpensive. Best part of this place is that there is food (chili cheese nachos, etc) for the patrons...FREE OF CHARGE! Love going here as a past stop of the night. Parking can be a hassle and it isn't in a great neighborhood but it adds to the culture! Definitely suggest going!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"NHL1c_30iYXvJZcqEo6fwQ","photo_id":"q4Uo4PbcKvfETah6UCFC6Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/q4Uo4PbcKvfETah6UCFC6Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8762537837028503},{"business_id":"NHL1c_30iYXvJZcqEo6fwQ","photo_id":"1-YRrM9Uc_Gw-jGa2OpBXQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/1-YRrM9Uc_Gw-jGa2OpBXQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8758317232131958},{"business_id":"NHL1c_30iYXvJZcqEo6fwQ","photo_id":"zIPRs-P9bDm6Sc9Fj1WfBQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/zIPRs-P9bDm6Sc9Fj1WfBQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8628578186035156},{"business_id":"NHL1c_30iYXvJZcqEo6fwQ","photo_id":"ahIcfIY1dH5WqMyxC-r8Rg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ahIcfIY1dH5WqMyxC-r8Rg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7962580919265747},{"business_id":"NHL1c_30i